# Inventory Management AI Agent 🤖

An AI-powered inventory management assistant built using **n8n, Mistral AI, and Google Sheets** to automate stock tracking, inventory queries, and sales logging.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

Managing inventory manually can lead to stock errors, delayed updates, and inefficient sales tracking.

This project demonstrates an AI agent that allows users to interact with inventory data using natural language. The agent can check stock information, update inventory after sales, and record sales transactions automatically.

---

## ✨ Features

### Inventory Management

- Check current inventory availability
- Retrieve product information
- Update stock quantities automatically after sales
- Maintain inventory records in Google Sheets

### Sales Management

- Record completed sales transactions
- Generate invoice references
- Store customer and transaction details
- Maintain sales history

### AI Agent Capabilities

- Natural language interaction
- Workflow-based decision making
- Tool usage with Google Sheets
- Memory-enabled conversations

